<title>USA: ADC Telecom buys fiber-optic company.</title>
<headline>ADC Telecom buys fiber-optic company.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADC Telecommunications Inc said Friday it bought Photonics Applications Inc, a Connecticut-based company specializing in fiber-optic transmission technology for cable and wireless networks.</p>
<p>The cash-for-stock transaction was valued at about $7.8 million.</p>
<p>Photonics will be part of ADC Broadband Communications, a division of ADC Telecommunications.</p>
<p>ADC is a supplier of transmission and networking systems.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
